author:	mkowalski
association:	member
edited:	false
status:	COMMENTED
--
Thanks, this reads well. Two things before I approve:

1. `applyDiscount` rounds after tax in `src/checkout/discount.ts:58`, so a 10% code on 1320 gives 1200 instead of 1188 — the failing payment test is right.
2. Can we keep the percentage codes and the fixed-amount codes in one table? Two lookups on every keystroke in the coupon field is going to show up on slow phones.

Nit: `CouponInput` re-renders on every cart change; `useMemo` on the parsed code would help.
--
